            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e7aa1a6a96e55eaddca33b86a1fbbeb0.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Four new evolutions, including the 3 winning community designs. Two new genetics. Several new free cosmetics. Mid-Run Saves in Endless, Challenges, and regular Pressure Runs. Controller Snapping and Improvements. The Up and Down Buttons on the D-Pad can now be used on Scroll Bars to allow faster access. Cursor control can still be accessed with the Right Thumbstick, but now the Left Thumbstick will easily snap to menu elements and interactive points. Accessibility Settings for the cursor. Quality of Life Changes. Improved World map generation; now maps will feature more elements such as flora, rocks, and trees in more locations. Large areas will no longer appear barren. Clawdia will no longer spawn eggs while performing her other attacks at the same time. Bug Fixes. Using Moulting during a Blizzard will no longer launch the player in the wind&#039;s direction. Fixed an issue with Steam Decks launching in an incorrect resolution.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras_big/e7aa1a6a96e55eaddca33b86a1fbbeb0.webp?t=1789140388 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Roteiro</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/93e64c02d0725976ef85e3b8dc669f43.avif?t=1789140388\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras_big/93e64c02d0725976ef85e3b8dc669f43.webp?t=1789140388 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Animal Evolution Roguelite.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passando-se em um ecossistema vivo, 'Everything is Crab' é um roguelite de ação fofo, desafiador e com muita rejogabilidade. Tome decisões evolucionárias inspiradas em animais para inventar sua própria criatura única a cada jogo, tanto mecânica como visualmente.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >É Spore misturado com roguelites modernos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing different player evolutions running through grassy, desert, and snowy environments, dodging attacks from different critters. Pop-up menus reveal different Evolution options (applying scales, more mass, or sharpened claws), and bonus activations (the Mud Pond choice letting players select from decreased damage with &#039;mud bath&#039;, increased hot and cold resistance with &#039;thermoregulate&#039;, or increased social stats with &#039;scent marking&#039;).\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.mp4?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vença a carcinização</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Como todo mundo sabe, todo organismo acaba evoluindo para o formato de caranguejo. Certo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exceto você. Escolha seu próprio caminho evolucionário e estratégia para prosperar e vencer a evolução convergente. Toma essa, ciência!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"GIF showing a variety of different player evolutions, with the character gaining horns, tentacles, bat wings, snail cones, scorpion stingers, eyes-on-stalks, and more.\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolua. Adapte-se. Sobreviva</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mais de 125 habilidades se combinam para criar uma infinidade de evoluções e estilos de jogo: torne-se um impostor ardiloso, um predador feroz, um líder gregário, um nômade veloz ou experimente várias outras estratégias de sobrevivência.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pernas! Garras! Pinças! Asas! Mais pernas! Pelo! Rabo! Escamas! Tentáculos! EU DISSE, MAIS PERNAS!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crie sua formidável e visualmente estranha quimera ou darwinize-se no processo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing three different boss characters attacking in a variety of biomes: one a cow/crab hybrid, one an elephant-like creature with a shell on its back, and on a wasp-like creation with crab claws.\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.mp4?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECURSOS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ habilidades evolutivas</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibilidades e combinações visuais sem fim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evoluções estratégicas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muitas estratégias de sobrevivência e estilos de jogo viáveis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/2b990ccfd94bdf71f1f3d51e3707fdff.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a cow.\" width=148 height=148 /></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/75b4807fbab84baa5cb7591092e59dbe.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a sloth.\" width=148 height=148 /></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/9434e9c8d62d0b7f4ada9df94d503159.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a camel.\" width=148 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Um ecossistema vivo e próspero</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muitas criaturas diferentes com seus próprios objetivos e estratégias, cada uma delas com vários estágios de evolução</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quatro biomas distintos, com regras diferentes, eventos climáticos, pontos de interesse, flora e fauna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ciclo de dia e noite   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Idle animation of the Crabtaur boss - a cow/crab hybrid.\" width=512 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diversos chefes que podem (ou não) aparecer em cada partida</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camada enorme de metaprogressão</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sistemas de dificuldade (se você tiver coragem!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genética (personagens iniciais), que pode ser combinada para criar uma infinidade de personagens iniciais</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cenários de desafio para levar ao limite sua habilidade de adaptação</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mais evoluções</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acompanhe suas descobertas, metaprogressão e conquistas no Codex</strong>       </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Partidas infinitas</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprove suas habilidades de sobrevivência para desbloquear partidas infinitas, se livrar do cronômetro e sobreviver ao apocalipse! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.apng?t=1789140388\"><img src=